	"bodyHtml": "<div class=\"d--flex\" style=\"flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n                    \n\n                                        \n                            <div id=\"id-34-71\" class=\"section section__textblock section--none section--padding bg-c--hard-conversion txt-c--nero title-c--nero link-c--nero\">\n      <div class=\"san-container\" data-span=\"full-desktop\">\n                    <div class=\"san-col\" data-span=\"12 desktop-xl-6\">\n        <div class=\"j-content txt--left pb--0 desktop-xl-pb--60\" data-block=\"\" data-type=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"j-content\" data-type=\"text\">\n          <h1>SOFT CHEWS AS PURRR-FECT TREATS!</h1>\n\n                </div>\n    </div>\n    </div>\n\n  <div class=\"san-col\" data-span=\"12 desktop-xl-6\">\n          <div class=\"j-content txt--left pt--0 desktop-xl-pt--60\" data-block=\"\" data-type=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"j-content\" data-type=\"text\">\n          <p>Voskes' small, soft chewy treats are healthy and suitable for both growing kittens and adult cats and make a delicious treat between meals or the <em>purrrr-fect</em> reward to teach your cat a host of tricks.</p>\n\n                </div>\n    </div>\n        </div>\n          </div>\n</div>\n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n                    \n\n                                        \n            \n            \n                                \n  \n<div id=\"id-38-27\" class=\"highlight section section--none txt-c--nero bg-c--white title-c--nero link-c--nero link-hc--nero\">\n    <div class=\"san-container p--0\" data-span=\"full\" data-options=\"\" data-no-gap=\"\"><div class=\"san-col highlight__media highlight__media--half\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\"><div class=\"ar-tablet-lg--2by1 ar--2by1 ar\" style=\"height: 100%;\"><div class=\"highlight__single-image ar__content\">\n      <img src=\"/uploads/landscape/landscape-snoepjes_18-images-38-27.png\" alt=\"FOR BOTH FISH AND MEAT LOVERS\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"obj--cover\">\n</div>\n</div></div><div class=\"san-col pv--15 tablet-lg-pv--0\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\"><div class=\"san-container ps--0 mobile-lg-ps--15 tablet-lg-ps--0 h-100\" data-span=\"full-tablet-lg\"><div class=\"san-col tablet-lg-ps--0\"><div class=\"j-content\" data-type=\"container\" data-centered=\"\" data-block=\"\"><div class=\"j-content txt--left\" data-type=\"text\"><h3>FOR BOTH FISH AND MEAT LOVERS</h3><p>With our different variants with chicken, duck or fish, there is guaranteed to be a cat snack for both four-legged fish fanatics and purebred meat lovers!</p></div></div>\n</div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n                    \n\n                                        \n            \n            \n                                \n  \n<div id=\"id-38-30\" class=\"highlight section section--none txt-c--nero bg-c--transparent title-c--nero link-c--nero link-hc--nero\">\n    <div class=\"san-container p--0\" data-span=\"full\" data-options=\"\" data-no-gap=\"\"><div class=\"san-col highlight__media highlight__media--half\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\" data-order=\"tablet-lg-2\"><div class=\"ar-tablet-lg--2by1 ar--2by1 ar\" style=\"height: 100%;\"><div class=\"highlight__single-image ar__content\">\n      <img src=\"/uploads/landscape/landscape-snoepjes_11-images-38-30.png\" alt=\"AT VOSKES, QUALITY IS KEY\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"obj--cover\">\n</div>\n</div></div><div class=\"san-col pv--15 tablet-lg-pv--0\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\" data-order=\"tablet-lg-1\" data-options=\"extra-padding--tablet-lg\"><div class=\"san-container ps--0 mobile-lg-ps--15 tablet-lg-ps--0 h-100\" data-span=\"full-tablet-lg\"><div class=\"san-col tablet-lg-ps--0\"><div class=\"j-content\" data-type=\"container\" data-centered=\"\" data-block=\"\"><div class=\"j-content txt--left\" data-type=\"text\"><h3>AT VOSKES, QUALITY IS KEY</h3><p>Besides outstanding taste, the ingredients and nutritional values of your cat's favourite snack are something to consider. At Voskes, excellent ingredients are key, so with Voskes snacks, your housemate will always enjoy a delicious cat snack without any worries!</p></div></div>\n</div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n                    \n\n                                        \n            \n            \n                                \n  \n<div id=\"id-38-29\" class=\"highlight section section--none txt-c--nero bg-c--white title-c--nero link-c--nero link-hc--nero\">\n    <div class=\"san-container p--0\" data-span=\"full\" data-options=\"\" data-no-gap=\"\"><div class=\"san-col highlight__media highlight__media--half\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\"><div class=\"ar-tablet-lg--2by1 ar--2by1 ar\" style=\"height: 100%;\"><div class=\"highlight__single-image ar__content\">\n      <img src=\"/uploads/landscape/landscape-snoepjes_152-images-38-29.png\" alt=\"Snacks for kittens\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"obj--cover\">\n</div>\n</div></div><div class=\"san-col pv--15 tablet-lg-pv--0\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\"><div class=\"san-container ps--0 mobile-lg-ps--15 tablet-lg-ps--0 h-100\" data-span=\"full-tablet-lg\"><div class=\"san-col tablet-lg-ps--0\"><div class=\"j-content\" data-type=\"container\" data-centered=\"\" data-block=\"\"><div class=\"j-content txt--left\" data-type=\"text\"><h3>FOR KITTENS TOO!</h3><p>Even the littlest ones love to be pampered sometimes! That's why our Voskes cat treats are also suitable for kittens from 3 months onwards.<br>Take care though, kittens still have a lot to grow and develop, so in the first year it is important they get the right nutrients. These get the best out of <strong><a href=\"/products/kitten-complete-chicken.html\" title=\"full-fat kitten food.\">full-fat kitten food.</a></strong></p></div></div>\n</div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n                    \n\n                                        \n            \n            \n                              \n\n<div id=\"id-38-28\" class=\"highlight section section--none txt-c--nero bg-c--transparent title-c--cat-primary link-c--nero link-hc--nero\">\n    <div class=\"san-container p--0\" data-span=\"full\" data-options=\"\" data-no-gap=\"\"><div class=\"san-col highlight__media highlight__media--half\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\" data-order=\"tablet-lg-2\"><div class=\"ar-tablet-lg--4by3 ar--4by3 ar\" style=\"height: 100%;\"><div class=\"highlight__single-image ar__content\">\n      <img src=\"/uploads/landscape/landscape-stapelen1-images-38-28.jpg\" alt=\"SOFT &amp; CHEWY TREATS for your cat\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"obj--cover\">\n</div>\n</div></div><div class=\"san-col pv--15 tablet-lg-pv--0\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\" data-order=\"tablet-lg-1\" data-options=\"extra-padding--tablet-lg\"><div class=\"san-container ps--0 mobile-lg-ps--15 tablet-lg-ps--0 h-100\" data-span=\"full-tablet-lg\"><div class=\"san-col tablet-lg-ps--0\"><div class=\"j-content\" data-type=\"container\" data-centered=\"\" data-block=\"\"><div class=\"j-content txt--left\" data-type=\"text\"><h3>WHY OUR SOFT &amp; CHEWY TREATS ARE IDEAL REWARDS FOR YOUR PET TIGER:</h3><ul><li><strong>Easy to chew</strong></li><li><strong>Suitable for kittens from 3 months</strong></li><li><strong>Easily digestible</strong></li><li><strong>Contain a lot of animal proteins</strong></li><li><strong>For both fish and meat lovers</strong></li><li><strong>Low in fat</strong></li><li><strong>A delicious taste!</strong></li></ul><a href=\"/cat-treats/soft-chewy-snacks.html\" class=\"btn mt--15 btn--nero btn--normal\">همه طعم‌ها را ببینید</a></div></div>\n</div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n            \n            \n      